{"ID":"20240118151113-ubok0fy","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151113-ubok0fy","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151113-ubok0fy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151113-puvrpgz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122134034-fn8nnhx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122134034-fn8nnhx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:297,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:315\u0026#125;","title":"215紫葳","type":"doc","updated":"20240201171445"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151113-puvrpgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151113-puvrpgz","updated":"20240122134019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味酸，微寒，无毒。治妇人产乳余疾，崩中，症瘕，血闭，寒热，羸瘦，养胎。生西海川谷及山阳。一名芺华，一名陵苕。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122134022-5meit4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122134022-5meit4k"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产山野，或栽植庭园，亦名凌霄花。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122134025-ufld43b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122134025-ufld43b"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味酸，性微寒，无毒（或作有毒）。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122134027-2suieft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122134027-2suieft"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】紫葳主行血通经，祛瘀血，治淋沥，清血中伏火。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122134028-ljjfw3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122134028-ljjfw3u"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】产后奔血不定，淋沥，主热风风痫，大小便不利，肠中结实。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122134030-5w7zb4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122134030-5w7zb4n"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】酒齄热毒风，刺风，妇人血膈游风崩中带下。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122134032-cv46hbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122134032-cv46hbn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一至二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122134033-r4znz72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122134033-r4znz72"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】花不可进鼻闻，伤脑，花上露入目昏蒙。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122134033-j0hu4ch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122134033-j0hu4ch"}},{"ID":"20240122134034-r0ny7cr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122134034-r0ny7cr"}},{"ID":"20240122134034-fn8nnhx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122134034-fn8nnhx","updated":"20240201171445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"紫崴，长这个样子。这药呢是行血通於的药，妇科我们常常用通经，月经没来，好用紫崴。紫葳我们取它的花类。因为是花类所以它走皮肤，走鼻子，所以它能够治鼻子的问题皮肤的问题，由于它能够行血通於，所以乳癌乳房硬块统统可以使用。它又有个名称称为凌宵花，它是味酸的，性微寒。你看它的颜色是紫色，它能够"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"行血通经，去於血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以妇科使用的比较多。你看那个大明说，酒糟，热毒蜂，赤蜂都可以使用。我们在这要更正一下。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"秦椒呢，就是开刀以后伤口长得很大，皮肤有红红的一条一条的鲜红色粉红色的，我们用秦椒。那是内服，有外用的，但不是秦椒也不是秦皮，用僵蚕，我们外面用僵蚕，僵蚕收疤的时候，收得疤皮肤颜色很漂亮。那秦椒秦皮呢我们可以做洗眼的药水用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]}